insights O
into O
the O
multidimensional O
pain O
response. O
PERSPECTIVE: O
Repeated O
painful O
stimulation O
resulted O
in O
patterns O
of O
habituation O
and O
sensitization, O
with O
large O
individual O
variability. O
Test-retest O
reliability O
was O
