with O
higher O
consistency O
for O
individuals O
that O
sensitize. O
A O
dissociation O
between O
ratings O
and O
SCR O
was O
demonstrated, O
with O
diverse O
response O
patterns O
of O
ratings O
and O
mostly O
habituation O
of O
the O
SCR. O

