iteratively O
spatially O
mask O
areas O
of O
the O
image O
as O
corruption O
and O
reconstruct O
them, O
then O
shrink O
the O
mask O
based O
on O
reconstruction O
error. O
This O
process O
iteratively O
unmasks O
'normal' O
areas O
to O
the O
model, O
whose O
information O
further O
guides O
reconstruction O
of O
'normal' O
patterns O
under O
the O
mask O
to O
be O
reconstructed O
