used O
to O
determine O
the O
longitudinal O
association O
among O
electroencephalogram O
abnormalities, O
steroid O
therapy, O
and O
neuropsychological O
findings. O
After O
genetic O
screening, O
the O
impact O
of O
identified O
GRIN2A O
missense O
variants O
on O
NMDAR O
function O
was O
assessed O
using O
