and O
outcomes. O
However, O
refined O
analysis O
of O
behaviors O
in O
epilepsy O
remains O
challenging. O
Current O
manual O
video O
inspection O
approaches O
are O
subjective, O
time-consuming, O
and O
often O
overlook O
the O
intricate O
behavioral O
dynamics O
and O
action O
