These O
findings O
also O
underscore O
the O
translational O
potential O
of O
video-based O
seizure O
behavior O
decoding O
in O
both O
inpatient O
and O
outpatient O
settings, O
including O
analyzing O
videos O
captured O
by O
home O
surveillance O
devices O
and O
ubiquitous O
