Surgery O
necessitates O
precise O
delineation O
of O
the O
epileptogenic O
zone O
(EZ) O
which O
proves O
especially O
challenging O
in O
the O
20% O
of O
PWE O
that O
remain O
MRI-negative. O
The O
purpose O
of O
this O
