maps O
with O
an O
isotropic O
resolution O
of O
3.4mm<sup>3</sup>. O
After O
exclusion O
criteria O
were O
applied, O
we O
assessed O
metabolite O
ratios O
in O
15 O
lesional O
and O
14 O
MRI-negative O
PWE. O
In O
the O
lesional O
group, O
