evidence O
indicating O
that O
they O
can O
mutually O
modulate O
their O
action. O
The O
present O
review O
focuses O
on O
available O
data O
delineating O
interactions O
between O
dopaminergic O
and O
oxytocinergic O
signaling O
in O
the O
striatum. O
In O
this O
context, O
recent O
data O
on O
the O
possible O
