- O
based O
on O
their O
performance O
in O
a O
tactile O
recognition O
task O
and O
a O
younger O
control O
group O
(N O
= O
20). O
We O
conducted O
a O
region O
of O
interest O
(ROI) O
to O
ROI O
analysis O
to O
evaluate O
FC O
between O
frontal O
regions O
connected O
via O
the O
aCC. O
Subsequently, O
