Multivariate O
pattern O
analysis O
reveal O
classification O
of O
retronasal O
odours O
within O
the O
insula, O
exhibiting O
overlapping O
representations O
with O
their O
associated O
tastes, O
particularly O
in O
the O
ventral O
anterior O
insula. O
Additionally, O
we O
observe O
temporal O
drift O
in O
insular B-Brain
taste O
