model O
of O
sporadic O
ALS O
based O
on O
the O
intracerebroventricular O
(i.c.v.) O
infusion O
during O
14 O
days O
of O
cerebrospinal O
fluid O
(CSF) O
from O
sporadic O
ALS O
patients O
into O
transgenic O
mice O
expressing O
human O
TDP-43<sup>WT</sup>. O
Either O
intrathecal O
(i.t.) O
or O
