Cognitive O
reappraisal O
is O
an O
emotional O
regulation O
strategy O
by O
which O
the O
individual O
changes O
the O
perspective O
on O
a O
situation O
to O
alter O
its O
emotional O
impact. O
Similar O
reinterpretation O
