primarily O
engages O
the O
left O
portion O
of O
the O
DLPFC, O
along O
with O
the O
ventrolateral O
PFC O
and O
dorsomedial O
PFC, O
while O
placebo O
primarily O
engages O
the O
right O
portion O
of O
the O
