is O
great O
interest O
in O
understanding O
the O
neural O
basis O
of O
this O
maturational O
process. O
The O
goal O
of O
the O
present O
study O
was O
to O
investigate O
how O
the O
resting-state O
and O
task-based O
functional O
connectivity O
(FC) O
patterns O
of O
two O
brain O
networks O
implicated O
in O
control O
processes, O
the O
fronto-parietal O
network O
(FPN) O
and O
the O
cingulo-opercular O
network O
(CON), O
contribute O
to O
individual O
differences O
in O
