symptoms O
in O
Parkinson's O
disease O
(PD). O
However, O
network-level O
functional O
reorganisation O
of O
BG O
disruption O
remains O
unclear. O
In O
this O
cross-sectional O
study, O
we O
applied O
functional O
gradient O
analysis O
based O
on O
a O
diffusion O
map O
embedding O
algorithm O
to O
delineate O
macroscale O
functional O
architectures O
of O
BG O
in O
102 O
PD O
patients O
and O
88 O
healthy O
controls O
(HCs). O
Partial O
least O
squares O
correlation O
analysis O
was O
employed O
to O
investigate O
the O
relationship O
between O
gradient O
alterations O
and O
clinical O
symptoms O
in O
PD. O
The O
first O
functional O
gradient O
of O
BG O
extended O
from O
caudate B-Brain
nucleus O
to O
