in O
BG O
circuit O
to O
clinical O
symptoms. O
The O
hemispheric O
asymmetry O
of O
gradient O
patterns O
may O
inform O
ongoing O
research O
on O
PD O
lateralisation. O
National O
Natural O
Science O
Foundation O
of O
China O
(Nos. O
82071423 O
and O
82021004) O
and O
Beijing O
Natural O
Science O
Foundation O
(No. O
JQ23033). O

