was O
manufactured O
during O
RT/TMZ, O
then O
injected O
subcutaneously O
over O
6 O
months O
concurrently O
with O
adjuvant O
TMZ. O
DC-ATA O
was O
reliably O
manufactured; O
treatment O
was O
well O
