Fifty-seven O
patients O
started O
vaccine O
therapy; O
69% O
received O
all O
eight O
vaccine O
doses. O
The O
10.7-month O
median O
progression-free O
survival O
(PFS) O
is O
57% O
greater O
than O
the O
average O
of O
medians O
from O
standard O
treatment O
arms O
in O
six O
randomized O
trials O
that O
also O
enrolled O
patients O
before O
RT/TMZ. O
Disease O
control O
and O
overall O
survival O
(OS) O
dropped O
