not O
separate O
until O
after O
DC-ATA O
was O
discontinued. O
Multivariate O
analysis O
identified O
receipt O
of O
all O
eight O
planned O
vaccine O
injections, O
<i>MGMT</i> O
promoter O
methylation, O
concurrent O
dexamethasone O
dose O
≤2 O
mg, O
and O
