Common O
features O
among O
the O
seven O
patients O
who O
were O
progression-free O
after O
3 O
years O
were O
eight O
vaccine O
injections, O
≤2 O
mg O
dexamethasone, O
age O
<60 O
years, O
and O
adjuvant O
TMZ O
given O
without O
concurrent O
bevacizumab. O
PFS O
was O
encouraging, O
and O
the O
data O
suggest O
that O
OS O
may O
