They O
are O
specific O
to O
neurons O
and O
astrocytes O
but O
are O
absent O
in O
other O
cell O
types O
we O
tested O
including O
HeLa O
cells, O
COS-7 O
cells O
and O
fibroblasts. O
We O
further O
identify O
Metallothionein O
III O
(MT3), O
a O
Zn<sup>2+</sup> O
buffering O
protein O
specifically O
expressed O
in O
brain O
