decodable O
in O
people O
with O
OUD O
in O
some O
value O
regions O
(ventromedial O
prefrontal O
cortex) O
and O
throughout O
the O
brain, O
especially O
within O
the O
limbic O
and O
salience/ventral-attention O
networks. O
Thus, O
while O
people O
with O
OUD O
engage O
a O
neurocomputationally O
similar O
process O
during O
risky O
decision-making O
to O
controls, O
they O
may O
differ O
in O
the O
fidelity O
and O
distribution O
of O
subjective O
value O
signals O
across O
brain O
networks.<b>Significance O
statement</b> O
A O
common O
assumption O
in O
addiction O
neuroscience O
is O
that O
people O
with O
substance O
use O
