that O
the O
integration O
of O
MRI O
biomarkers O
into O
a O
closed-loop O
clinical O
system, O
as O
envisioned O
by O
precision O
psychiatry, O
holds O
great O
promise O
for O
the O
individualized O
management O
of O
MDD, O
improving O
clinical O
outcomes O
from O
diagnosis O
through O
recovery. O

