people O
to O
prove O
their O
claims, O
it O
may O
also O
exacerbate O
credibility O
gaps O
and O
social O
biases. O
The O
article O
concludes O
that O
careful, O
context-specific O
assessments O
are O
essential O
before O
brain-based O
inferences O
are O
adopted O
in O
socially O
significant O
decisions. O

The O
