was O
to O
validate O
the O
use O
of O
AI-based O
AQUA O
(Neurophet O
Inc., O
Seoul, O
Republic O
of O
Korea) O
segmentation O
software O
in O
a O
Southeast O
Asian O
community-based O
cohort O
with O
normal O
cognition, O
mild O
cognitive O
impairment O
(MCI) O
and O
dementia. O
