rates, O
as O
occur O
in O
e.g., O
atrial O
fibrillation, O
or O
decreased O
clearing, O
possibly O
related O
to O
endothelial O
cell O
dysfunction, O
disturb O
this O
balance. O
This O
could O
lead O
to O
continuing O
loss O
of O
capillaries, O
micro-infarcts, O
and O
cognitive O
decline. O

