data O
from O
296 O
employed O
individuals O
(n<sub>female</sub> O
= O
202; O
M<sub>age</sub> O
= O
45.4; O
SD<sub>age</sub> O
= O
11.3; O
range<sub>age</sub> O
= O
19.5-67.1) O
