as O
a O
critical O
bottleneck O
in O
the O
subcortex-cortex O
communication O
involved O
in O
affective O
behavior.<b>Significance O
Statement</b> O
The O
paraventricular O
thalamic B-Brain
nucleus O
(PVT) O
is O
a O
critical O
