These O
findings O
suggest O
that O
tool-hand O
incongruence O
evokes O
action O
competition O
and O
influences O
the O
tool-use O
difficulties O
experienced O
by O
people O
with O
apraxia.<b>Significance O
Statement</b> O
Prior O
research O
indicates O
that O
competition O
between O
different O
representations O
associated O
with O
moving O
or O
using O
tools O
