explore O
interactions O
among O
clinical, O
biological O
and O
imaging O
data. O
A O
predictive O
model O
will O
be O
developed O
and O
validated O
for O
clinical O
use. O
ICTUSCOG O
will O
provide O
critical O
insights O
into O
the O
mechanisms O
and O
trajectories O
of O
PSCI, O
informing O
prevention, O
early O
intervention, O
and O
rehabilitation O
strategies. O
The O
work O
aims O
to O
establish O
predictive O
tools O
and O
care O
pathways O
to O
mitigate O
