groups. O
Patients O
in O
the O
low O
MVD O
group O
exhibited O
significantly O
longer O
progression-free O
survival O
(PFS, O
p O
< O
0.001) O
and O
overall O
survival O
(OS, O
p O
< O
0.001) O
than O
