assigned O
to O
two O
experimental O
groups O
with O
two O
different O
temporal O
inter-flash O
intervals O
(IFI) O
between O
stimuli O
(250 O
ms: O
250-IFI O
group; O
500 O
ms: O
500-IFI). O
Two O
stimulation O
