of O
active O
transcranial O
electrical O
stimulation O
(tES) O
and O
one O
control O
condition O
were O
tested O
on O
the O
left O
precuneus/inferior O
parietal O
gyrus: O
(i) O
transcranial O
alternating O
current O
stimulation O
(tACS) O
at O
the O
individual O
alpha O
frequency O
(IAF) O
(IAF-tACS); O
(ii) O
transcranial O
random O
noise O
stimulation O
across O
the O
whole O
alpha O
band O
(i.e., O
8-12 O
Hz, O
Alpha-tRNS) O
and O
(iii) O
a O
placebo O
(Sham) O
stimulation. O
The O
postdiction O
phenomenon O
was O
observable O
in O
both O
experimental O
groups. O
The O
participants O
in O
the O
500-IFI O
group O
demonstrated O
enhanced O
performance O
in O
detecting O
the O
illusion O
during O
the O
rabbit O
illusion O
task O
