of O
ADRD. O
HIGHLIGHTS: O
The O
diagnostic O
and O
staging O
criteria O
for O
Alzheimer's O
disease O
(AD) O
were O
updated O
in O
2024. O
Despite O
robust O
harmonization O
methods O
for O
amyloid O
beta O
positron O
emission O
tomography O
(PET), O
parallel O
efforts O
for O
tau O
PET O
remain O
challenging. O
Larger O
anti-amyloid O
drug O
effects O
were O
seen O
at O
lower O
levels O
of O
amyloid O
and O
tau O
PET. O
Phosphorylated O
tau217 O
(p-tau217) O
is O
currently O
the O
most O
promising O
plasma O
biomarker O
to O
detect O
AD O
pathology. O
There O
are O
new O
tracer O
developments O
for O
alpha-synuclein, O
primary O
tauopathies, O
and O
inflammation. O

Low O
cerebral O
perfusion O
pressure O
(CPP) O
has O
previously O
been O
identified O
as O
a O
key O
prognostic O
marker O
after O
pediatric O
