data O
or O
from O
author-defined O
populations O
at O
risk. O
From O
1854 O
screened O
articles, O
32 O
eligible O
population-based O
studies O
were O
identified. O
Sixteen O
were O
on O
prevalence O
and O
22 O
on O
incidence O
reporting O
FTD O
measures, O
including O
those O
with O
estimates O
for O
the O
whole O
population O
and O
for O
specific O
age O
subgroups. O
Pooled O
crude O
incidence O
for O
FTD O
was O
2.28 O
(95% O
CI, O
1.55-3.36) O
per O
100 O
000 O
person-years O
and O
prevalence, O
9.17 O
(95% O
CI, O
3.59-23.42) O
per O
100 O
000 O
people. O
The O
behavioral-variant O
FTD O
pooled O
crude O
incidence O
was O
1.20 O
(95% O
CI, O
0.67-2.16) O
per O
100 O
000 O
person-years O
and O
