36 O
articles O
were O
finally O
used O
in O
the O
review. O
The O
mean O
age O
of O
the O
pediatric O
and O
adult O
patients O
was O
5.78 O
± O
4.38 O
and O
39.07 O
± O
19.4 O
years, O
respectively. O
About O
59.7% O
(49) O
were O
men, O
40.24% O
(33) O
were O
women, O
and O
44.23% O
(46) O
did O
not O
present O
with O
any O
