(three O
(23.07%)), O
penicillin O
(three O
(23.07%)), O
and O
steroids O
(three O
(23.07%)). O
Injectable O
metronidazole O
500 O
mg O
thrice O
daily O
was O
given O
for O
an O
average O
of O
13 O
weeks, O
and O
injectable O
ceftriaxone O
2 O
g O
once O
daily O
was O
given O
for O
an O
average O
of O
six O
weeks. O
Our O
results O
indicated O
that O
a O
combination O
of O
surgical O
and O
medical O
