an O
average O
of O
23.4 O
weeks O
showed O
complete O
resolution O
in O
two O
(15.38%) O
patients O
and O
a O
reduction O
in O
abscess O
cavity O
size O
in O
the O
other O
two O
(15.38%). O
This O
review O
underscores O
that O
both O
medical O
and O
surgical O
treatment O
together O
resulted O
