this O
end, O
an O
in O
vivo O
murine O
model O
of O
distal O
middle O
cerebral O
artery O
occlusion O
(dMCAO) O
was O
employed, O
alongside O
an O
in O
vitro O
model O
utilizing O
oxygen-glucose O
deprivation/reperfusion O
in O
HT22 O
​cells. O
The O
results O
indicated O
that O
TUG-891 O
significantly O
enhanced O
neurological O
function, O
reduced O
the O
volume O
of O
cerebral O
infarction, O
and O
alleviated O
pathological O
damage O
following O
