Moreover, O
TUG-891 O
demonstrated O
a O
significant O
reduction O
in O
oxidative O
stress O
levels, O
a O
decrease O
of O
markers O
related O
to O
endoplasmic O
reticulum O
(ER) O
stress, O
and O
the O
modulation O
of O
critical O
apoptotic O
regulators, O
thereby O
inhibiting O
apoptosis O
in O
both O
in O
vivo O
and O
in O
vitro O
settings. O
Additionally, O
TUG-891 O
was O
found O
to O
affect O
the O
PI3K/Akt O
signaling O
pathway, O
with O
the O
application O
of O
the O
inhibitor O
LY294002 O
negating O
