centers, O
formed O
an O
exploratory O
(158 O
ET, O
172 O
PD) O
and O
a O
validation O
dataset O
(30 O
ET, O
54 O
PD). O
Established, O
standardized O
tremor O
characteristics O
were O
assessed O
for O
their O
cross-center O
accuracy O
and O
validity. O
