This O
study O
establishes O
the O
use O
of O
feature-based O
ML O
as O
a O
powerful O
method O
to O
explore O
accelerometry-derived O
tremor O
signals. O
The O
combination O
of O
hypothesis-free, O
data-driven O
analyses O
and O
a O
large, O
multicenter O
dataset O
represents O
a O
relevant O
step O
towards O
big O
data O
analysis O
in O
tremor O
disorders. O
