testing O
(Aβ O
ratio, O
p-tau181, O
p-tau231, O
p-tau217, O
NfL), O
and O
a O
subset O
with O
imaging O
biomarker O
assessments O
(Aβ O
PET, O
tau O
PET, O
structural O
MRI) O
formed O
an O
imaging O
subcohort. O
Multiple O
linear O
regression O
models O
identified O
the O
most O
predictive O
markers O
within O
each O
modality O
and O
evaluated O
the O
effect O
of O
combining O
A/T/N O
biomarkers. O
Among O
1,614 O
plasma O
cohort O
and O
130 O
imaging O
subcohort O
participants, O
tau O
markers O
demonstrated O
the O
strongest O
predictive O
value. O
p-tau217MSD O
outperforming O
other O
plasma O
